> An option would be to change it from x2 damage versus
> everything to +dX damage against everything, as you have
> done with some of the banes.

The problem with changing multipliers to additional damage is that it
makes the weapon a lot more powerful right when you get it and
decreases the usefuless of having to enchant it.  I like the idea that
the weapons that end up doing the most damage require enchantment
before they really start becoming useful.  It makes for interesting
tradeoffs like Excalibur being great in the early game if you can get
it, but bad in the late game because you it doesn't multiply damage.

